GEOMETRY NOTICE (added 2026-07-31)

The CC BY 4.0 licence above covers the facts and the hand-traced geometry.
Route geometry traced from OpenStreetMap (progressively, from 23 July 2026;
in this release: Brenner, Oslo-Goteborg, Oslo-Stockholm, Pustertalbahn) is
a derivative of OpenStreetMap data and is therefore
(c) OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under the Open Database License
(ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
OSM copyright and attribution: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

If you reuse the geometry wholesale, the safe and correct default is to
treat it as ODbL and credit OpenStreetMap contributors.
